' Rejected: fork inside fork.
' Our parser rejects nested forks to keep path enumeration tractable
' and visual complexity manageable (ADR-009-style guardrail).
' Rewrite: flatten to a single fork with more branches, or separate
' the inner parallelism into a sub-process.
@startuml
start
fork
  :task A1;
  fork
    :task A1a;
  fork again
    :task A1b;
  end fork
fork again
  :task B1;
end fork
stop
@enduml
